    <description>&lt;p&gt;Texas ACM and Longhorn Developers (LHD) are hosting a joint social to bring members of both organizations together! The goal is to help students meet others in the UT tech community outside their usual circles and build connections through a series of fun games and activities. Food will be provided for those who RSVP&#039;ed. We can&#039;t wait to see you there!&lt;/p&gt;
