<item>
    <title>LLM Reasoning Reading Group</title>
    <link>https://apps.cs.utexas.edu/calendar/rooms/334198</link>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Directed Reading Program (DiRP) group on LLM Reasoning: LLMs may just be stochastic parrots using next-token prediction, but they are somehow able to perform shockingly well in a variety of tasks and demonstrate complex reasoning. In this group we will read some landmark papers that have brought us from mere text auto-complete bots to powerful AI agents. We may potentially explore reasoning epistemically and advancements of AI reasoning beyond just text.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
     <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:00 CST</pubDate>
 <dc:creator>Eve Feng</dc:creator>
 <guid isPermaLink="false">334198</guid>
  </item>
